      "message": "I don\u0027t recall seeing code that sets the time. The `force_time` command mentions the caveat that [changing the time can cause problems](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/timer.c;l\u003d397-401;drc\u003d599c438e80c634a580c33bfb431472cf36c1cad5).\n\nI\u0027ll add a warning.",
